= Hugo Urbahns

Hugo Urbahns was a KPD leader during the Hamburg Uprising and formerly the leader of the Leninbund. Of course, many former Leninbund members have come ot our party after our shift in ideology. He is also one of the few on our left who supports working with the SPD.

